WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.120
Doesn't ever wake you  in the middle of the night...

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.660
...The feeling that some day they'll pass that foolish law?

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.860
Is it true? they can cure us?

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.480
There are mutants so powerful, that they can enter out minds...

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.760
...And control our toughts

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.400
Thaking away our God given free will

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.000
The truth is

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.380
That mutants are very real

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.620
And they are among us

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.560
We must know...

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:30.700
...Who they are...

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:32.900
...And above all we must know...

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:34.980
What they can do?

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.580
Don't give up on them Erik

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:41.980
What you'll have me do Charles?

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.960
I've heard those arguments before

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:47.800
It was a long time ago

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.460
Mankind has evolved since then

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:53.180
Yes, into us

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.500
Peace was never an option

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:00.380
Charles!

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:05.580
War is still coming Charles

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.220
and I intend to fight it

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:12.940
The real enemy is out there

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:18.900
You have no idea what I have done

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:21.960
I know that you took the things that meant the most to me

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.200
Well maybe you should have fought harder for them

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:27.080
You would die for them?

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:28.800
Not for them...

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.160
...For you!

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.000
We need you to hope again

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:37.960
The world needs the X-Men

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:42.260
Not all of us can control our powers

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.280
Then don't!

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:54.700
I have never felt power like this before

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.180
Don't let it control you

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:07.080
It's all of us against a god

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:19.220
You are not students anymore...

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:21.720
You're X-Men!

